{"book":"2kings","num":8,"verses":[{"en":"Then spake Elisha unto the woman, whose son he had restored to life, saying, Arise, and go thou and thine household, and sojourn wheresoever thou canst sojourn: for the LORD hath called for a famine; and it shall also come upon the land seven years.","n":1,"sm":"Sunema, atoa ma isi mea na tutupu i Isaraelu Ua fai atu Elisaia i le fafine na faaolaina e ia lana tama tane, ua faapea atu, Tu ia i luga, ina outou o ma lou aiga, ia āumau i se mea e mafai ona e āumau ai; aua ua valaau e le ALII i le oge; e oo ai foi i le nuu i tausaga e fitu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Sunema,"},{"en":"","sm":"atoa"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"isi"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"tutupu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"Isaraelu"},{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"Elisaia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"fafine"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"faaolaina"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"lana"},{"en":"","sm":"tama"},{"en":"","sm":"tane,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faapea"},{"en":"","sm":"atu,"},{"en":"","sm":"Tu"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"luga,"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"lou"},{"en":"","sm":"aiga,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"āumau"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"mafai"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"āumau"},{"en":"","sm":"ai;"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"valaau"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"oge;"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"oo"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"nuu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"tausaga"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"